  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of new Water project in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Royal Danish Embassy in Addis Ababa (RDE) is conducting an appraisal of the new water water project Document for Ethiopia: Rapid Groundwater Resource Mapping for IWRM in Ethiopia (2024-2028) to to support integrated water resource management in Ethiopia through cost effective identification and management of groundwater resources for climate-resilient rural and urban water supplies using modern geophysical technologies. The RDE is commissioning an appraisal of the proposed project to be conducted as a quality assurance measure, before a project is put forward for decision making.</narrative>
  </description>
